,{"id":"dpB_YqwpwZE","position":50,"timestamp":"01:52:15","rawTrack":"Tweet - Turn Da Lights Off (feat. Missy Elliot)","track":{"id":"1oO8d3KCu4A","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot/","slug":"turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot","title":"Turn Da Lights Off (feat. Missy Elliot)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"qQ2OKsEqx9I","slug":"514","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-514/ra.1575992521","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-514"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #514","artwork":"images/episodes/soulection-radio-show-514.jpg","content":"Music from Phabo, Blxst & Bino Rideaux and Sango.\n<!--more-->\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7367,"location":"US","published_at":"2021-07-17T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"KAB5memZqL4","position":70,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Call Me (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"kp1LZqh40Kc","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me-instrumental/","slug":"call-me-instrumental","title":"Call Me (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"_AEYEZL77io","position":88,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Turn Da Lights Off feat. Missy Elliot","track":{"id":"1oO8d3KCu4A","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot/","slug":"turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot","title":"Turn Da Lights Off (feat. Missy Elliot)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"dEwqVSYtHgQ","position":45,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Call Me (Instrumental)","track":{"id":"kp1LZqh40Kc","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me-instrumental/","slug":"call-me-instrumental","title":"Call Me (Instrumental)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me-instrumental.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"V9gjzB6oDrw","position":72,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Oops (Palace Raw Version)","track":{"id":"D_7_NBVaBwo","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/oops-palace-raw-version/","slug":"oops-palace-raw-version","title":"Oops (Palace Raw Version)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/oops-palace-raw-version.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"6HHQNRsrLR0","slug":"146","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-146"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #146","artwork":"/images/episodes/146.jpg","content":"Joe Kay hits hard with 3 hours of HEAVY tracks on 1 hour of sleep\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThere is something for everybody in here. Lots of unreleased music + music that was forgotten about. Shouts to all the amazing people who tuned in to the live show. Every once in a while we like to make a post about the location of our radio listeners and it's always inspiring to see how many people are actually tuning in and the locations that they reside in. We can't even pronounce some of the cities/countries! Talk about worldwide. Lets keep it moving.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-28T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"DDwpDGhPQy4","position":26,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Call Me","track":{"id":"ia1yYrjVpKw","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me/","slug":"call-me","title":"Call Me","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"SOSUPERSAM's Set","position":1}},{"id":"IEJnEvN6S_Q","position":29,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Call Me","track":{"id":"ia1yYrjVpKw","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me/","slug":"call-me","title":"Call Me","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/call-me.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"A-2xaCFrXnk","slug":"150","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-150-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #150 w/ SOSUPERSAM","artwork":"/images/episodes/150.jpg","content":"Talented & vibrant woman SOSUPERSAM finally came through the studio. \n\n<!--more-->\nIt's been a long time coming and we're happy that you finally get a feel for who she is musically and as a person. Wasn't quite sure what she was gonna play for us, but she showed a great diversity and really brought us back to a place that was very much needed towards the end of her set. She's even cooler as a person. Being humble and driven will always get you far. Joe Kay really brought out a diverse selection of music. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10814,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-11-02T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"SOSUPERSAM's Set","position":1}},{"id":"duo0jUK9YrA","position":32,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Turn Da Lights Off feat. Missy Elliot","track":{"id":"1oO8d3KCu4A","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot/","slug":"turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot","title":"Turn Da Lights Off (feat. Missy Elliot)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"AfbBMadJe6c","slug":"162","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-162"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #162","artwork":"/images/episodes/162.jpg","content":"Joe reaches out to the listeners for the People Choice\n\n<!--more-->\n\nComing off Grammy week connections and our 3 Year Anniversary we returned for yet another solid show. Our special guests who were scheduled for this show couldn't make it but Joe Kay brought out a variety of new and classic gems from the Soulection crates. This show was really engaging because Joe reached out to all the listeners and asked the audience what they wanted to hear via social media. It was amazing to see how many people were listening and how many people requested for a certain track. For the last hour and 1/2 you the people we're DJ'ing/selecting music! How amazing right? Try to tune in live next time. The live feelings is always better. We'll catch you next week at the same time. Spread this if you feel it because it really is strictly about the music. Stay tuned for our 3 Year Anniversary Party announcement on Monday (1/27/14).\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-01-18T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"QRfdcrDGo5I","position":46,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Tweet - Turn Da Lights Off feat. Missy Elliot","track":{"id":"1oO8d3KCu4A","path":"/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot/","slug":"turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot","title":"Turn Da Lights Off (feat. Missy Elliot)","artist":{"slug":"tweet","title":"Tweet"},"artwork":"images/artists/tweet/tracks/turn-da-lights-off-feat-missy-elliot.png"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"9hHKn1wcY4c","slug":"186","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-186"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #186","artwork":"/images/episodes/186.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10890,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-09-21T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"mz6fxcf